e felfelan’!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Pi’in nranod ni kar feked awochngin e woldug ma yad be yor","poem":1},{"text":"e bay ra sulod ni yad be tang u fithik’ e felfelan’,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ni kar feked i yib e ggan nike yag riy ngorad!","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/126.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/127.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/yap_bsm/PSA/125.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}